  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `crates/app/tests/pocket_pass_start.rs`: the test `fig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge` takes 94 s in debug on main. It now has `#[ignore = \"heavy lane: app heavy: pocket_pass_start (94 s in debug, #3587)\"]`. It keeps all its asserts and its two strategies (Waterline and Offset rings).\n- The asserts of one strategy move into the helper `assert_outside_starts_at_the_stock_edge`. The full test calls it for each strategy.\n- New light twin `fig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge_light`. It checks the same law on Waterline only: at least 2 levels, the first ring outside the stock box, the last point on the part wall.\n\n## Readings: each test alone, debug, origin/main `5c05d0660`\n\nMain at `5c05d0660` does not build `camcraft-app` (#3716, fixed by PR #3715). For these readings only, the one-line arm of PR #3715 was applied locally. That line is not in this PR.\n\n| Test | Seconds (debug) |\n|---|---|\n| `fig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge` | 94.19 |\n| `fig8_pocket_inside_starts_each_level_on_the_part_wall` | 25.63 |\n| `fig8_pocket_auto_keeps_the_core_first_order` | 13.24 |\n| `fig8_zigzag_pocket_says_pass_start_is_not_used` | 44.88 |\n| `fig8_rest_pocket_says_pass_start_is_not_used` | 1.42 |\n| `pocket_pass_start_rides_mcp_undo_and_the_file` | 0.81 |\n\nOnly the Outside test is over 60 s. The 961 s of the issue comes from the branch of PR #3577 (ramp entry, verifier cost #3615). On main the test is slow, but not stalled.\n\n## Times after the change\n\n- Light twin, debug: 44.51 s.\n- Light twin, release: 3.62 s. `cargo xtask gate light --only \"app light: pocket_pass_start\"` (`CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=6`): ok, 529 s step time with the release build.\n- Full test, release: 8.35 s. `cargo xtask gate release --only \"app heavy: pocket_pass_start\"`: ok, 22 s.\n- `cargo xtask gate release --dry-run` shows the step `app heavy: pocket_pass_start`.\n- `cargo xtask gate light --dry-run` shows the step `app light: pocket_pass_start` with the filter `fig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge_light`.\n\n## Counts\n\n- `#[test]` count of the file: 6 before, 7 after (+1 twin).\n- Not ignored: 6 before, 5 after. Ignored: 0 before, 2 after (the full test and the twin).\n- No assert is removed.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `fig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge` (heavy lane)\n- `fig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge_light` (light lane)\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- The full debug suite of the binary after the change was not run as one step. The other 5 tests are not changed.\n- `fig8_zigzag_pocket_says_pass_start_is_not_used` takes 44.88 s in debug. It is under 60 s and stays in the debug suite.\n- The other app suites were not checked for the same latency class.\n\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --test pocket_pass_start -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #3587\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
